      "summary": "# Conversation Summary\n\n1. **Initial Request**: User asked to add auto-scroll-to-top functionality when the chat ID changes to display the first message.\n\n2. **Solution Implemented**: Added a `watch` object monitoring `chat.doc_id` to detect when the active chat switches.\n\n3. **Method Created**: Implemented `scrollToTop()` method that resets the scroll container's scroll position to 0px instantly.\n\n4. **Integration**: The watcher automatically triggers `scrollToTop()` whenever the chat ID changes, ensuring users always see the beginning of the conversation.\n\n5. **Result**: Complete Vue component updated with proper state management and scroll behavior for seamless chat navigation between different conversations.",
